{"chunk_id": "894c64b0bada", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "乳制品基本面介绍：", "date_hint": "", "text": "乳制品产业链涵盖上游牧场、中游加工企业/品牌商和下游的经销商、零售渠道等。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "894c64b0bada", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "b8fc2c366026", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "乳制品基本面介绍：", "date_hint": "", "text": "上游牧场主要涉及原料主要可分为生鲜乳/原奶（未经杀菌、均质等工艺处理的奶畜原奶）和大包粉（生鲜乳经消毒、脱水、喷雾干燥制成），另外上游原材料也涉及聚乙烯、铝、纸板、玻璃等包装材料。\n中游乳制品加工企业大部分为品牌商，将上游原材料加工制造为乳制品后向下游出售，一般中大型乳制品加工企业自有牧场布局，受奶源限制仍然需要向中小型牧场、奶农收购原奶。\n下游渠道以线下为主，中游乳企将产成品分销给各区域经销商/大型商超/电商，一般为买断代销。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "b8fc2c366026", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "5a9d85d92e0e", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "乳制品基本面介绍：", "date_hint": "", "text": "原奶供给不足，奶源分布不均", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "5a9d85d92e0e", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "e645087993e3", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "乳制品基本面介绍：", "date_hint": "", "text": "中国是乳制品需求大国、原奶“贫国”。乳制品进口绝对量大，2021 年中国乳制品进口量占全球贸易量的23.6%，其中婴配粉、液体乳分别为29%、26%。中国乳制品的对外依赖程度较高，分品类来看，液体乳的自给率较高，2022 年为 97%，近年来需求旺盛，自给率逐年下降；奶粉对外依赖程度较高，2022 年为57%。\n国内黄金奶源带分布方面，主要集中于北方地区，北纬43度至53度之间为优质奶牛饲养带，此区域贯穿东北、西北和华北地区，全国约70%的奶牛集中于此，供应了超60%的原料奶。、", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "e645087993e3", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "bafe229ea831", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "乳制品基本面介绍：", "date_hint": "", "text": "原奶的波动主要分为2 类：季节性周期和外生性冲击。其中季节性周期可控性较强，而外生性冲击考验的则是乳企的实力，规模大、奶源布局广的乳企更具备抗风险能力。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "bafe229ea831", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "02be9382a716", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "乳制品基本面介绍：", "date_hint": "", "text": "中国人均饮奶量提升空间巨大。中国2021 年人均奶类消费量为14.4 公斤，和发达国家水平仍然有较大差距，折合每天消耗39.45 克，远未达到《中国居民膳食指南（2022）》的标准。新版膳食指南将奶及奶制品的推荐摄入量由每天300 克调整为每天 300-500 克，并且加入了干酪制品，加强了对奶制品的重视。根据《全国奶业发展规划（2016-2020 年）》的估计，全国人均牛奶饮用量仅为世界平均水平的1/3，发展中国家平均水平的1/2。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "02be9382a716", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
